- Hey, I am smoke.

00:02:21.568 --> 00:02:22.560
- [Parvesh] That was me.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.440
That was, that was me.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.511
That was my very first
commercial with Cecily.

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:28.920
And I'm much older than her.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.460
So she was, I think,
were you in high school?

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.060
- Yeah, yeah. I was a
junior in high school.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.300
- And I was like, I think
a junior in college.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.020
So it was my first commercial.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.350
And I think you named me in it.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.480
I think like there's like one take when,

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.350
Cecily got my name right, too.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.860
She was like, Oh, that's Parvesh.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.575
And I'm like, "Hey, good."

00:02:45.575 --> 00:02:46.590
- Hey, I like her.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:47.790
- Yeah.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.563
- I just love you that
you said "I am smoke."

00:02:50.563 --> 00:02:51.432
(group laughing)

00:02:51.432 --> 00:02:52.308
That's awesome.

00:02:52.308 --> 00:02:53.141
- Yeah, my accident work.

00:02:53.141 --> 00:02:54.590
I've been doing it for decades.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:55.423
- [Kelly] It was amazing.

00:02:55.423 --> 00:02:57.780
- I mean, we met before we even realized

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:58.871
