00:02:58.871 --> 00:03:01.823
And then I think I saw it
on the internet was like,

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:03.650
Oh my God.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.860
- Yeah, you texted me.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.960
Like after we had met,
you texted me, like,

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.940
I think this is you. And I'm like it is.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:10.773
And it was just..

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:12.270
- [Kelly] How random is that?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.650
- Because it was..

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:14.483
- [Cecily] Isn't that bizarre?

00:03:14.483 --> 00:03:15.320
- But you know what?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.550
Like your first job,
you're just so scared.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.070
So I don't remember
too much from that day.

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:22.460
And so it was just like so
surreal, like, Oh my God.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.420
Cecily from TV was that,

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.737
that kid who was like
leading this commercial?

00:03:26.737 --> 00:03:27.803
- Far from TV.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.607
- No, but wait, you have a
new show "Connecting," right?

00:03:32.607 --> 00:03:33.440
- [Parvesh] I do.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.280
- I love this. So, what
is connecting about?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.890
- Well, connecting is very topical.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:36.830
It's one of the..

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.850
It's a Zoom comedy about, you know,

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.440
all of us with the stay at home orders,

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.642
the pandemic right now.

00:03:41.642 --> 00:03:43.330
And there'd been a couple of them,

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.220
but this is an ongoing series

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.040
that'll be on NBC Thursday nights.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.063
And, it's a group of seven friends and

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.000
just living life and I am the dad

00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:55.510
and who works in PR

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.140
and is having a little
trouble problem with his kids.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.280
You know? How is it with you?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:05.010
- Toddlers are fun when you're
working from home, everybody.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.843
- Yeah.

00:04:05.843 --> 00:04:07.700
- So wait, so what's the hardest part

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.830
