your living room though?

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:10.750
- Well, I'm kind of,

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.170
I'm still kind of getting used
to being out in the world.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.120
This is like maybe my second day

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.672
like being around more than two people.

00:04:17.672 --> 00:04:18.550
- Yeah.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.780
- I'm one, I'm one of those
like strict people at home.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.613
- I'm strict.

00:04:21.613 --> 00:04:22.446
- Yeah.

00:04:22.446 --> 00:04:23.279
- Yeah. And we, I mean, like,

00:04:23.279 --> 00:04:24.720
I feel like I'm an expert on like

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.580
wiring and sound and lighting.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.460
We do it all.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:32.130
Like my partner, he, when
he's home from his normal job,

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.530
he might help, barely.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.570
He's like, I need to rest, too.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.757
I'm like, okay, let me light this.

00:04:37.757 --> 00:04:41.690
And like, but we do everything:
makeup, hair, wardrobe.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:42.523
- [Kelly] Nope.

00:04:42.523 --> 00:04:43.690
- And then last minute,

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.150
oh, and don't forget your one
page monologue you have to do.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.260
- Right. You're everything.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.960
So it's the acting is the
last thing we worry about.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.940
So I'm just playing this
character, just like myself.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:55.773
- I literally,

00:04:55.773 --> 00:04:58.050
I thought that I was going
to get fired once this hit

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:00.023
because it like, cause it was like,

00:05:00.917 --> 00:05:03.350
I'm not doing hair and
makeup. I was like..

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.269
- Well on Dancing,

00:05:04.269 --> 00:05:05.260
- Mama's coming on screen.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.424
- On Dancing, it's the same thing.

00:05:06.424 --> 00:05:08.690
- And it is what it is.
I don't like doing it.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.897
So I was like, well,
if no one can be here,

00:05:10.897 --> 00:05:12.071
- [Cheryl] Oh well!

00:05:12.071 --> 00:05:13.101
- Sorry for you, America.

00:05:13.101 --> 00:05:14.610
- I do feel bad sometimes

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.380
like the guys don't always have to.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.370
And, I know it's a new world
where everyone can wear every

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.850
makeup, everything, but I
just never was that person.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:26.060
And I just even popping
into your lovely vanities

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.660
department, the hair and makeup people,

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.480
they just give a quick.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.720
- No, they give you that
Harry Potter touch up

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.843
that you're like what
happens? It's me in color.

00:05:32.843 --> 00:05:34.370
- [Parvesh] I just felt
like, am I in a spa again?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.763
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:35.763 --> 00:05:37.520
- Like it feels like to
be pampered by someone

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.590
doing your hair and
makeup again after like

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.020
months of just like, oh gosh.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.720
Oh, that zit, I got to cover that.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.487
- So, everybody you can watch
connecting Thursdays on NBC.

